[{"client_msg_id":"59baeada-b1bc-4573-ac05-a7aeae47ce4f","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"AFMは私の代のときたまたまいなくて機械はあったんですが、触れなかったんですよね。。\nどんな感じで見えるのか見てみたかった。。","ts":"1634738982.171300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"P3yF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"aae279ff-1b61-4599-8c1d-f0591e7e3776","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"精密技術を極めた上で力技なのが良い","ts":"1634738725.171100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"JSy"}]},{"client_msg_id":"57c4cb5e-5e20-4320-9b0b-1cb4bc6877f5","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"今まで見た中で一番好きな研究、atomically flatな表面に一原子ずつ載せて発光波長を完全に揃えた（誇張なし）量子ドットを製造しました、っていうやつ","ts":"1634738512.169600","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"goodpoem","count":3,"users":["UDPT2BZ6E","UAZ33BKV2","U022XK5866Q"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"DS5R2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6cc6e60d-2d5c-4f9a-b0c4-a057b54c6061","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"あるSFで陽子サイズのブラックホールがネタなんだけど、STMというか近未来機器で質量を押し込めてたのを思いだした。","ts":"1634738366.166900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6DD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9E3FD9C2-F98C-4E87-B7E8-F609B7F203D2","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"STMのプローブは自作でしたね。電解研磨法です","ts":"1634738344.166400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Cvnqy"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7bd66032-f6c6-4f5b-8e01-57771b108da4","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"一原子単位の加工もできるし、ロマンがある","ts":"1634738290.165000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kdDsO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"42987a42-1c72-4c11-9f44-66c939e33c39","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"走査プローブ系の開発はさきっちょに何でもセンサーつけまくって色々してて大変そうだけど楽しそう","ts":"1634738219.164000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"FWuXO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2a30a141-2283-4a56-b6d4-f97a571d1813","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"あとSTMの中は24時間超高真空にしてあるんですが、中に入れてる試料がどんどん汚れていくので、平面が少なくなってくるとスパッタリングして定期的にリセットしないとですね。","ts":"1634738154.162800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"eRa"}]},{"client_msg_id":"08751b2c-9b7b-4d1b-ac7c-9b5c6477182f","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"もちろん分子は見えませんが","ts":"1634738154.162600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Nk2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5fa851a1-d765-41b1-8798-3c867a95dbd6","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"AFMは速くて楽ちんだったな","ts":"1634738148.162300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qOADB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"632a95d9-6684-4ff6-b14a-527d6c3220b1","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"あ、すいません離席してました。\nSTMの視野決めるの大変ですよ。半分くらい行ってから(6~7分)視野にすごい谷があることが分かったり。","ts":"1634738057.161900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+HYXZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"94c6e163-bfa9-42ad-a637-aa9208ec7b5c","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"せめてSEMとくっついてて欲しいですね。集束イオンビーム (FIB) はSEM付きで扱いやすかった","ts":"1634736414.161700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"sNXYR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"be870a99-7639-4cb6-8d76-5be02b8754d6","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"しかもOMでnmスケールの位置合わせをろくにできる気がしないという……。","ts":"1634736349.161100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"G28E"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6d6a4a9b-b9e8-491b-a974-7c02af5410f7","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"OMと組み合わせたとしてもしんどそうな遅さ","ts":"1634736175.160400","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sorena","count":1,"users":["U022XK5866Q"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+BTT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"21e677e2-d277-426b-9dd8-4b6f334cc526","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"そういえばSTMの走査の遅さは視野決めるのに苦労しそうですね。光学顕微鏡とかと組み合わせてた感じですか？","ts":"1634735976.159900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"X6R"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d984d4bc-297a-4cd9-a6f1-e587e3c3b526","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"ある理由でコントローラを管理してますが、うっかり置くとボタンを疲弊させるので、がんばって立て掛けてますね....","ts":"1634735870.159100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fyvF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0a017f2a-3dae-4e3e-95ac-2227fb9f4f12","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"そっと置きましょう","ts":"1634735819.158600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"g2oq6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"de1af46d-7fba-4c3d-a9f9-36223c6e9284","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"ラマン分光機のコントローラがXBOXのやつで、机に置くとL2R2が反応してキレそうになったことがある","ts":"1634735809.158300","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"warau","count":1,"users":["U022XK5866Q"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4qHWl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6542ca8d-5b7c-402d-8922-064ed40c75ee","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"プラズモンでピカピカしてそう","ts":"1634735698.157000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"RKie2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7e8170a9-0495-4ee7-ace2-4ba31398386b","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"ボタン押し続けるのけっこうつらいですしね。\n• ざっくり大きく移動 → ジョイスティック or トラックボール\n• y軸とかを固定して移動 → ボタン\n• 高精度に移動 → 視野をダブルクリック\nで使い分けてました。","ts":"1634735694.156900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qWgj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0da36fc6-b302-42b1-b8cf-1984efb068dd","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"表面とかいうヤベーやつ、人間の手に負えないややこしさがある","ts":"1634735666.156200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4gR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2ab0beeb-1a0e-4b7d-b4b4-41719499665e","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"実験装置のコントローラがゲーム用コントローラなの、あるあるなんですかね","ts":"1634735571.154400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"s7=el"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7bbd40ba-90a2-44f7-940c-399b4e282f9f","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"（すごい昔なので数字間違ってるかも）","ts":"1634735541.153600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"We=r"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0e9f2809-30ba-43f9-a710-72b36538c0cd","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"（STMは15nm x 15nm撮るのに15分とかかかる）","ts":"1634735521.153000","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"hiee","count":1,"users":["U022XK5866Q"]},{"name":"totemoturai","count":1,"users":["U01D9BALEKU"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"dl9Y"}]},{"client_msg_id":"29218706-a954-4425-9e6e-a917324a5523","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"うちもです。Hitachi製はトラックボールだったかな。JEOLはボタンかジョイスティックだったような。","ts":"1634735520.152900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"UKt"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c08bf52b-668e-4d74-b245-2ea2ba3fb61a","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"SEMは分子は見えないけど像を取る時間が短くて羨ましかったです。","ts":"1634735494.152200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"CEhhw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"96bf824f-d88b-4d22-9d8f-639fa1ffeba3","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"SEMはslimbladeみたいなやつで場所を決めれるようになってました。それもちょっと触らせてもらいました。","ts":"1634735450.151100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"j4Rl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1fc5a48c-990a-45ec-b89b-a6463d5720a0","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"走査型トンネル顕微鏡ってSTMなのか。STEM (SEMとTEMの間の子) もあるし、略称ややこしいですね。","ts":"1634735411.150300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"yRd"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bd164bf0-4b60-4fbf-829b-89e83554642e","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"STM、トンネル効果で像が見えるってのが面白かったですね","ts":"1634735383.149500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"DuEzW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"516acaba-317f-4635-84b3-e52671f7769c","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"実のところSEM使ったことなし","ts":"1634735378.149300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"wQ0Gy"}]},{"client_msg_id":"66429bb6-3b84-4808-a504-1a387f1d6c94","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"へえー","ts":"1634735320.148000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"b11m"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0212d425-d360-4132-b19a-4ea0bf0d8d07","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"STM使ってました。同じ研究室の隣の島はSEM\n\u003chttps://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%B5%B0%E6%9F%BB%E5%9E%8B%E3%83%88%E3%83%B3%E3%83%8D%E3%83%AB%E9%A1%95%E5%BE%AE%E9%8F%A1\u003e\n\u003chttps://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%B5%B0%E6%9F%BB%E5%9E%8B%E9%9B%BB%E5%AD%90%E9%A1%95%E5%BE%AE%E9%8F%A1\u003e","ts":"1634735172.147500","attachments":[{"fallback":"wikipedia: 走査型トンネル顕微鏡","id":1,"author_name":"Wikipedia","author_link":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/","title":"走査型トンネル顕微鏡","title_link":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%B5%B0%E6%9F%BB%E5%9E%8B%E3%83%88%E3%83%B3%E3%83%8D%E3%83%AB%E9%A1%95%E5%BE%AE%E9%8F%A1","text":"走査型トンネル顕微鏡（そうさがたトンネルけんびきょう、Scanning Tunneling Microscope(STM)）は1982年、ゲルト・ビーニッヒ(G. Binnig)とハインリッヒ・ローラー(H. Rohrer)によって作り出された実験装置であり、走査型プローブ顕微鏡の一形式である。日本語において従来からある光学顕微鏡や電子顕微鏡の装置名のつけ方からすると走査型トンネル効果プローブ電子顕微鏡などが相応しいのであるが、より簡便な言い回しもまた必要であり現在では走査型トンネル顕微鏡または単にトンネル顕微鏡と呼ばれる。非常に鋭く尖った探針を導電性の物質の表面または表面上の吸着分子に近づけ、流れるトンネル電流から表面の原子レベルの電子状態、構造など観測するもの。トンネル電流を使うことからこの名がある。","image_url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0f/Scanning_Tunneling_Microscope_schematic.svg/1200px-Scanning_Tunneling_Microscope_schematic.svg.png","blocks":null,"service_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/unfurl_icons/wikipedia.png","from_url":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%B5%B0%E6%9F%BB%E5%9E%8B%E3%83%88%E3%83%B3%E3%83%8D%E3%83%AB%E9%A1%95%E5%BE%AE%E9%8F%A1","original_url":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%B5%B0%E6%9F%BB%E5%9E%8B%E3%83%88%E3%83%B3%E3%83%8D%E3%83%AB%E9%A1%95%E5%BE%AE%E9%8F%A1"},{"fallback":"wikipedia: 走査型電子顕微鏡","id":2,"author_name":"Wikipedia","author_link":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/","title":"走査型電子顕微鏡","title_link":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%B5%B0%E6%9F%BB%E5%9E%8B%E9%9B%BB%E5%AD%90%E9%A1%95%E5%BE%AE%E9%8F%A1","text":"走査型電子顕微鏡（そうさがたでんしけんびきょう、英語: Scanning Electron Microscope、SEM）は電子顕微鏡の一種である。電子線を絞って電子ビームとして対象に照射し、対象物から放出される二次電子、反射電子（後方散乱電子、BSE）、透過電子、X線、カソードルミネッセンス（蛍光）、内部起電力等を検出する事で対象を観察する。通常は二次電子像が利用される。透過電子を利用したものはSTEM（走査型透過電子顕微鏡）と呼ばれる。\nTEMでは主にサンプルの内部、SEMでは主にサンプル表面の構造を微細に観察する。","image_url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/09/Scanning_electron_microscope_hg.jpg/1200px-Scanning_electron_microscope_hg.jpg","blocks":null,"service_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/unfurl_icons/wikipedia.png","from_url":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%B5%B0%E6%9F%BB%E5%9E%8B%E9%9B%BB%E5%AD%90%E9%A1%95%E5%BE%AE%E9%8F%A1","original_url":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%B5%B0%E6%9F%BB%E5%9E%8B%E9%9B%BB%E5%AD%90%E9%A1%95%E5%BE%AE%E9%8F%A1"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"LsVc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"01a3332e-a3e4-4b92-9daa-aa9244d9a9ae","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"私、卒論はナノテクノロジーだったのでこういうポンプ使ってました。\n分子見えるの楽しかったです。","ts":"1634735113.146800","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"hee","count":1,"users":["UL6CFN8NR"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nL1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1d3ff67c-862e-4305-bb8d-a32fafbc8621","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"\u003chttps://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E3%82%BF%E3%83%BC%E3%83%9C%E3%83%9D%E3%83%B3%E3%83%97\u003e\nいろいろある","ts":"1634734817.145700","attachments":[{"fallback":"wikipedia: ターボポンプ","id":1,"author_name":"Wikipedia","author_link":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/","title":"ターボポンプ","title_link":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E3%82%BF%E3%83%BC%E3%83%9C%E3%83%9D%E3%83%B3%E3%83%97","text":"ターボポンプ\n\n羽根車を使用するポンプ。ポンプ#非容積(ターボ形)ポンプを参照。\nロケットエンジンの推進器のうち、液体燃料の移送に使用されるタービンを使用したターボポンプ。\n高精度の真空ポンプであるターボ分子ポンプ。","image_url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9a/A4-Turbopumpe.jpg/1200px-A4-Turbopumpe.jpg","blocks":null,"service_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/unfurl_icons/wikipedia.png","from_url":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E3%82%BF%E3%83%BC%E3%83%9C%E3%83%9D%E3%83%B3%E3%83%97","original_url":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E3%82%BF%E3%83%BC%E3%83%9C%E3%83%9D%E3%83%B3%E3%83%97"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"knbPk"}]},{"client_msg_id":"db39c2ed-8842-45b4-ba5b-86f65bf5d099","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":":smile:","ts":"1634734760.145400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"REYOS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1431f29b-be88-400c-9e7c-268abbae9215","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"もう化学分析からは離れたから、怒られない……はず :yoshi:","ts":"1634734742.145200","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"yoshi","count":1,"users":["U01D9BALEKU"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4OtgG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"911dfc44-21b0-4b6f-bbae-224a66ac9c0a","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"学生時代はEPMAでロータリーポンプとディフュージョンポンプ見て、すげーってなってました。前職ではAr同位体分析用に質量分析計があったので、ターボポンプも登場して、原理聞いたとき、まじかよってなりました。","ts":"1634734694.144600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+hEo"}]},{"client_msg_id":"575d86f7-10f5-43f3-8367-80a0d0f1370a","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"こんなこと言ってると怒られそうだ","ts":"1634734690.144500","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"me-too","count":1,"users":["U022XK5866Q"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Vqk"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d38fa99a-753b-43fa-815e-8aa5451f8e16","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"ターボポンプ、ボタンを押したら真空になってくれる便利装置としか認識してない（よく知らない）","ts":"1634734511.142700","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"me-too","count":1,"users":["U022XK5866Q"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fYQXQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5b149304-1d03-4129-a9a5-0f93a615615d","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"\u003chttps://srad.jp/~phason/journal/601297/\u003e","ts":"1634734349.141700","attachments":[{"fallback":"電子の粘性によって生じる局所負性抵抗 | phasonの日記 | スラド","id":1,"title":"電子の粘性によって生じる局所負性抵抗 | phasonの日記 | スラド","title_link":"https://srad.jp/~phason/journal/601297/","text":"\"Negatice local resistance caused by viscous electron backflow in graphene\"D. A. Bandurin et al., Science, 351, 1055-1058 (2016).","thumb_url":"https://srad.jp/static/topics/journal_64.png","blocks":null,"service_name":"srad.jp","service_icon":"https://srad.jp/static/favicon.ico","thumb_width":64,"thumb_height":64,"from_url":"https://srad.jp/~phason/journal/601297/","original_url":"https://srad.jp/~phason/journal/601297/"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4sBGM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e7